    "Scouting Notes": "Starter\n Very projectable, only 17 at draft time, long limbs\n Definite SP repertoire\n Fastball is not big in velo right now, but it generates great carry and will play up above the velo\n Cutter is a solid cutter shape already, thrown a few MPH slower than the fastball\n Curve/Slider are technically only a slider right now, but I'd bet the Brewers separate them into two pitches. Slider gets curve-ish.\n Changeup is a major WIP, bad shape and not much velo killed. Kills spin decently.\n Command is solid for a young guy like himself, but unsurprisingly it's also inconsistent\n Definitely a project, but a very fun one. Could take a couple years before the results start to show up.",
